# Whitelist policy: ignore everything, then re-include the tracked files one
# by one. Any file NOT listed below is invisible to git: `git add` will refuse
# it. When adding a new file to the repository, add its rule here first.
*

!.gitignore
!README.md
!early-init.el
!init.el

# ... e i temi personali.
# La cartella va riammessa PRIMA dei file che contiene: se una directory
# resta esclusa, git non vi entra nemmeno e le eccezioni sui file interni
# non vengono mai valutate.
!themes/
!themes/*.el

# Deliberately untracked, already covered by the `*` rule above:
#   elpa/        packages installed by package.el
#   backups/     backup copies
#   auto-saves/  auto-save files
#   custom.el    machine-local settings written by M-x customize
